    <item>
      <title>my favourite bookstores around the world</title>
      <link>https://www.nickybu.blog/garden/my-favourite-bookstores-around-the-world/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 23 Jun 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://www.nickybu.blog/garden/my-favourite-bookstores-around-the-world/</guid>
      <description>a collection of bookstores I&amp;rsquo;ve visited and loved on planet Earth</description>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<h2 id="malta">Malta</h2>
<ul>
<li>SOLO Vinyl &amp; Books</li>
