    <item>
      <title>now</title>
      <link>https://www.nickybu.blog/garden/now/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 06 Mar 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://www.nickybu.blog/garden/now/</guid>
      <description>what am I doing with my life right now?</description>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>
<p>Moved to London to start a PhD @ <a href="https://sadehlab.com/">Sadeh Lab</a> (Francis Crick Institute) and <a href="devneuro.org.uk/marinlab/">Marin Lab</a> (King&rsquo;s College London) exploring the role of cortical interneurons in regulating excitation/inhibition feedback loops during learning.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>check out what <a href="/garden/bookshelf/#books-I%27m-currently-reading...">books I&rsquo;m currently reading</a></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><a href="">bedroom DJing</a> and <a href="">experimentally making electronic music with synths and samplers</a></p>
</li>
</ul>
]]></content:encoded>
